+ * quarter of a skinning job's time). Here each is one pshufb whose index is built from
+ * the SPU byte arithmetic: host byte j holds SPU byte j ^ 3 (SPU_W), so the host index of
+ * SPU byte s is s ^ 3, and an index with bit 7 set makes pshufb write zero. Integer
+ * operations only: the same bytes as the _ref loops for every input
